WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,130 --> 00:00:03,250
Someone is out

2
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:13,650
Just now

3
00:00:14,010 --> 00:00:15,930
While a lot of wheat is attracted to that unlucky guy

4
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:23,250
You guys go out quickly and make a sneak attack from behind. I haven’t seen you yet.

5
00:00:23,490 --> 00:00:36,500
We held back the hatred and continued practicing.

6
00:00:37,730 --> 00:00:38,770
Just change the crossbow after shooting.

7
00:00:38,970 --> 00:00:42,800
No need to waste time filling it up

8
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:46,060
grow very fast

9
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:47,540
I also want to practice my skills

10
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:51,060
But the risk of breaking in is about 5%.
